    <string name="privacy_summary_text">Your library, playlists, queue, and settings stay on this device. If you enable automatic online lyrics, Xargoosh sends song title, artist, album, and duration to LRCLIB over HTTPS when synchronized lyrics are unavailable offline. When you start music recognition, up to 12 seconds of microphone audio is sent to AudD over HTTPS to identify the music. Xargoosh contains no ads, analytics, accounts, or tracking SDKs.</string>
